{
  "project_id": 21,
  "project_label": "gemma",
  "task_id": 9602,
  "title": "The hidden opportunities of the informal economy",
  "author": "Niti Bhan",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/niti_bhan_the_hidden_opportunities_of_the_informal_economy",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T00:59:58.835647Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T00:59:58.835647Z",
  "lead_time": null,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 35,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "stereotypically seen",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7687D75752",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 85,
        "text": "The informal markets of Africa are stereotypically seen as chaotic and lackadaisical.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9F1934EC88",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 52,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "automatic grand association",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "81547547FC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 179,
        "endOffset": 203,
        "text": "adding -- or subtracting",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9CB7F19EB5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 276,
        "text": "The downside of hearing the word \"informal\" is this automatic grand association we have, which is very negative, and it's had significant consequences and economic losses, easily adding -- or subtracting -- 40 to 60 percent of the profit margin for the informal markets alone.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6224E1EE0C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 191,
        "text": "As part of a task of mapping the informal trade ecosystem, we've done an extensive literature review of all the reports and research on cross-border trade in East Africa, going back 20 years.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2454C92D33",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 51,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "what was the problem, what was holding back",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0E96AACFB2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 133,
        "text": "This was to prepare us for fieldwork to understand what was the problem, what was holding back informal trade in the informal sector.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2E36422064",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 219,
        "text": "criminalization",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EB16159603",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 219,
        "text": "What we discovered over the last 20 years was, nobody had distinguished between illicit -- which is like smuggling or contraband in the informal sector -- from the legal but unrecorded, such as tomatoes, oranges, fruit.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C32DDC4F42",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 398,
        "endOffset": 440,
        "text": "engine of what keeps the economies running",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4DB31D6F52",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 441,
        "text": "This criminalization -- what in Swahili refers to as \"biashara,\" which is the trade or the commerce, versus \"magendo,\" which is the smuggling or contraband -- this criminalization of the informal sector, in English, by not distinguishing between these aspects, easily can cost each African economy between 60 to 80 percent addition on the annual GDP growth rate, because we are not recognizing the engine of what keeps the economies running.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D3C94E2EA8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 97,
        "endOffset": 113,
        "text": "\"modern\" economy",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6009A54B86",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 131,
        "text": "The informal sector is growing jobs at four times the rate of the traditional formal economy, or \"modern\" economy, as many call it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BD80E20035",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 69,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "\"unskilled\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F6A12C089A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "It offers employment and income generation opportunities to the most \"unskilled\" in conventional disciplines.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AA5D638BBC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "But can you make a french fry machine out of an old car?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CD73F5A8AF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "But can you make a french fry machine out of an old car?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D5B0CD0F91",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "So, this, ladies and gentlemen, is what so desperately needs to be recognized.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D25D575A0F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 45,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "this is criminal, this is shadow, this is illegal",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D1491CF158",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 207,
        "text": "As long as the current assumptions hold that this is criminal, this is shadow, this is illegal, there will be no attempt at integrating the informal economic ecosystem with the formal or even the global one.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "390F647024",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "I'm going to tell you a story",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "33A24E987D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 185,
        "text": "I'm going to tell you a story of Teresia, a trader who overturned all our assumptions, made us question all the stereotypes that we'd gone in on, based on 20 years of literature review.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8606DC583A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "Teresia sells clothes under a tree in a town called Malaba, on the border of Uganda and Kenya.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EA9E66D606",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "You think it's very simple, don't you?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8608059525",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "You think it's very simple, don't you?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0C4B2BAECE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "We'll go hang up new clothes from the branches, put out the tarp, settle down, wait for customers, and there we have it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "28567916FA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 83,
        "endOffset": 96,
        "text": "right down to",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9CEF9B8B03",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 155,
        "text": "She was everything we were expecting according to the literature, to the research, right down to she was a single mom driven to trade, supporting her kids.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4CBB4F87CD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "So what overturned our assumptions?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "82740DD811",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "So what overturned our assumptions?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BB786BF91C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "What surprised us?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CBFF425D34",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "What surprised us?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A85D1D1E5B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 131,
        "text": "First, Teresia paid the county government market fees every single working day for the privilege of setting up shop under her tree.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "880A471497",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "She's been doing it for seven years, and she's been getting receipts.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7A42CD075D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "She keeps records.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AF31D5A01C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "invisible",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B8C443235A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "We're seeing not a marginal, underprivileged, vulnerable African woman trader by the side of the road -- no.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0E8FE30FD2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 287,
        "text": "We were seeing somebody who's keeping sales records for years; somebody who had an entire ecosystem of retail that comes in from Uganda to pick up inventory; someone who's got handcarts bringing the goods in, or the mobile money agent who comes to collect cash at the end of the evening.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "254D0B3DB3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 127,
        "text": "Can you guess how much Teresia spends, on average, each month on inventory -- stocks of new clothes that she gets from Nairobi?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2143ADBDD2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 127,
        "text": "Can you guess how much Teresia spends, on average, each month on inventory -- stocks of new clothes that she gets from Nairobi?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5DB646246A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "One thousand five hundred US dollars.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9B4A0FA46B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "That's around 20,000 US dollars invested in trade goods and services every year.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2D4D712014",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 17,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "the invisible one, the hidden middle",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5DB9B57960",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "This is Teresia, the invisible one, the hidden middle.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "36C3907F2A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 119,
        "text": "And she's only the first rung of the small entrepreneurs, the micro-businesses that can be found in these market towns.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "704633BD8C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "At least in the larger Malaba border, she's at the first rung.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "573F4D3584",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 130,
        "text": "The people further up the value chain are easily running three lines of business, investing 2,500 to 3,000 US dollars every month.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6BAAC89DA0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 129,
        "text": "So the problem turned out that it wasn't the criminalization; you can't really criminalize someone you're charging receipts from.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0CA6C598FB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "It's the lack of recognition of their skilled occupations.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C80DCA71AD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 120,
        "endOffset": 162,
        "text": "her tree doesn't have a forwarding address",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0566D5D1CC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 110,
        "endOffset": 118,
        "text": "you know",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
